# Cloudflare Pages 响应头（2026-10-03 从 vercel.json 迁移）
# 与 Vercel 版保持一致：HTML 不缓存、blog/data 走协商缓存

/
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/blog/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
